  "description": "This walk explores John's Hill near Bunclody in Wexford. The hill is located just to the west of the town and includes miles of woodland trails and panoramic views of the River Clody Valley, the River Slaney valley and Mount Leinster from the high points. There is a parking area just off the L2026 where you can pick up the trails. You can continue your walking in the area on the Blackstairs Mountain Walk.",
